{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779500/extras/d673e716dc37bef0303b3006d4e3fc36.avif?t=1760024263\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> More than 10 Different Pinballs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragging two identical pinballs together allows you to synthesize a higher-level pinball.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Rich and Diverse Monster Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different monsters with unique skill effects are continuously unlocked based on the difficulty of the levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Flexible Level Selection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing each level, you can choose a higher-level stage to earn a higher score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Equipment Selection and Random Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select one piece of equipment when upgrading; both the equipment's quality and stats are random.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Skill Selection and Random Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose one skill when upgrading, with a maximum of 12 skills selectable in total. The skill's cost and CD are somewhat random.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Data Statistics and Analysis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor individually counts the data of each type of pinball, making it easier to make better choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Achievement System and Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After unlocking achievements, you can obtain different initial bonuses.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Synthesize a Pinball to Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3779500/a017c8964280e28170a3a37e8e409737d48a56e7.jpg"},{"name":"Synthesize a Pinball to Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam